# Sleep Trading WebApp

A simple paper-trading dashboard that simulates a trading bot running while you sleep. It includes:

- live dashboard UI
- bot settings and risk controls
- paper-trading position tracking
- auto-trading loop with simulated signals
- reset and monitoring screen

## Features

- Capital and risk configuration
- Max daily loss guardrail
- Position limits
- Simulated trend-following strategy
- Action log and recent signal feed

## Run locally

```bash
npm install
npm start
```

Then open http://localhost:3000

## Notes

This app is intentionally built for simulation and paper trading, not live brokerage execution. It is a safe starter project for learning automation and bot logic.

## Safe usage

- Start in paper-trading mode
- Keep risk caps low
- Do not connect live capital until you have tested thoroughly
- Monitor logs and health checks

## Project structure

- `server.js` — Express backend and trading loop
- `public/index.html` — dashboard layout
- `public/styles.css` — interface styling
- `public/app.js` — dashboard logic

